    Install OpenXR layer's JSON manifest in correct path on Unix
    
    According to [0], this is the correct path for a JSON manifest for an
    OpenXR layer on unix-like operating systems.
    
    [0] https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/loader.html#linux-manifest-search-paths

diff --git a/layer/CMakeLists.txt b/layer/CMakeLists.txt
